### ─────────────────────────────────────────────
### HelpRest API
### Compatible: VS Code REST Client + Insomnia
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api

# After running "Login", copy the accessToken to this variable:
@accessToken = PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════
###  HEALTH CHECK
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Content-Type: application/json

### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════
###  AUTH (OAuth-Only)
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════

### Google OAuth2 Login
# @name googleLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/google
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "googleIdToken": "PASTE_GOOGLE_ID_TOKEN_HERE"
}

### Refresh Token
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "PASTE_REFRESH_TOKEN_HERE"
}

### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════
###  USER
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════

### Get My Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Update Profile
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/me
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "name": "João Atualizado",
  "socialLinksEnabled": true,
  "socialLinks": {
    "instagram": "@joao.teste"
  }
}

### Update User Flags
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/me/flags
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "flagIds": []
}

### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════
###  FLAGS
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════

### List All Active Flags
GET {{baseUrl}}/flags
Content-Type: application/json

### List All Flags Including Inactive (Admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/flags/admin/all
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Create Flag (Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/flags
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "type": "dietary",
  "identifier": "sugar-free",
  "description": "Estabelecimento com opções sem açúcar",
  "tag": "Sem Açúcar",
  "backgroundColor": "#E2B93B",
  "textColor": "#FFFFFF"
}

### Update Flag (Admin)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/flags/REPLACE_WITH_FLAG_ID
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "tag": "Zero Açúcar",
  "isActive": true
}

### Batch Reorder Flags (Admin)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/flags/reorder
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "orders": [
    { "id": "REPLACE_WITH_FLAG_ID", "order": 1 }
  ]
}

### Delete Flag (Admin)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/flags/REPLACE_WITH_FLAG_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════
###  ESTABLISHMENTS
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════

### List Establishments
GET {{baseUrl}}/establishments?page=1&limit=5
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Get Recommended (Curitiba centro)
GET {{baseUrl}}/establishments/recommended?lat=-25.429&lng=-49.27&limit=10
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Get Nearby (5km, Curitiba centro)
GET {{baseUrl}}/establishments/nearby?lat=-25.429&lng=-49.27&maxDistance=5000&limit=10
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Search Establishments
GET {{baseUrl}}/establishments/search?q=vegano&page=1&limit=10
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Get My Managed Establishment (Establishment Admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/establishments/my-establishment
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Get Single Establishment
GET {{baseUrl}}/establishments/REPLACE_WITH_ID
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Create Establishment (Establishment Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/establishments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "companyName": "Novo Restaurante Teste",
  "location": {
    "state": "PR",
    "city": "Curitiba",
    "neighborhood": "Centro Cívico",
    "address": "Rua Teste, 123",
    "coordinates": { "lat": -25.42, "lng": -49.27 }
  },
  "flagIds": [],
  "logo": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1512621776951-a57141f2eefd?w=200&h=200&fit=crop"
}

### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════
###  PRODUCTS (Establishment Admin)
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════

### Create Product
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "establishmentId": "REPLACE_WITH_ESTABLISHMENT_ID",
  "name": "Bowl Vegano",
  "description": "Grão-de-bico, quinoa e legumes assados",
  "price": 39.9,
  "ingredients": ["grão-de-bico", "quinoa", "abobrinha"],
  "flags": []
}

### Update Product
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/products/REPLACE_WITH_PRODUCT_ID
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "price": 42.9,
  "isActive": true
}

### Delete Product
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/products/REPLACE_WITH_PRODUCT_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════
###  VISITS & SOCIAL
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════

### Create Visit
POST {{baseUrl}}/visits
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "establishmentId": "REPLACE_WITH_ID",
  "rating": 5,
  "review": "Excelente restaurante! Opções veganas deliciosas."
}

### Report Visit / Review
POST {{baseUrl}}/visits/REPLACE_WITH_VISIT_ID/report
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "reason": "Conteúdo impróprio ou ofensivo"
}

### List User Visits
GET {{baseUrl}}/visits/user/REPLACE_WITH_USER_ID?page=1&limit=10
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### List Establishment Visits
GET {{baseUrl}}/visits/establishment/REPLACE_WITH_ID?page=1&limit=10
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Get Social Feed
GET {{baseUrl}}/social/feed?lat=-25.429&lng=-49.27&page=1&limit=15
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════
###  FAVORITES
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════

### Get User Favorites
GET {{baseUrl}}/favorites
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Add Favorite
POST {{baseUrl}}/favorites
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "referenceId": "REPLACE_WITH_ID",
  "type": "establishment"
}

### Remove Favorite
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/favorites/REPLACE_WITH_REFERENCE_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════
###  ADMIN (role: admin / superadmin)
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════

### Admin Dashboard Metrics
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/dashboard
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### List Reported Visits
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/visits/reported?limit=20&skip=0
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Moderate Reported Visit
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/visits/REPLACE_WITH_VISIT_ID/moderate
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "isModerated": true,
  "reason": "Violação dos termos de uso"
}

### List Users
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users?page=1&limit=20
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Update User Role
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/REPLACE_WITH_USER_ID/role
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "role": "establishment_admin"
}

### Ban / Unban User
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/REPLACE_WITH_USER_ID/ban
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "isBanned": true,
  "reason": "Spam recorrente"
}

### Get User History
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/REPLACE_WITH_USER_ID/history
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### List Admin Audit Logs
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/audit-logs?page=1&limit=20
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
